compact('b191','連結負孔壓傳遞、排水能力與卸載回彈判斷真空壓密~Relate suction transfer, drainage capacity and unloading rebound to vacuum consolidation',r'''
有效應力增量~Effective stress increment || 真空預壓透過降低孔隙水壓增加有效應力，不需要把相同荷載全由堆載重量提供。必須先說清楚所選土點的總應力是否保持不變，並區分抽氣系統壓力與土中孔壓。~Vacuum preloading increases effective stress by reducing pore pressure rather than supplying all loading through fill weight. Specify whether total stress stays fixed at the selected soil point and distinguish pump pressure from soil pore pressure. || 教學假設總應力固定、孔壓變化Δu=−60kPa，Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa；此式不代表任何深度都收到相同負壓。~At fixed total stress and pore-pressure change Δu=−60kPa, Δσ′=−Δu=60kPa. The relation does not imply equal suction at every depth. || 同步量測土中孔壓、地表荷載及沉陷，將每個測點換到相同高程基準。確認負孔壓感測能力與飽和狀態，讓有效應力推論有可追溯的原始資料。~Synchronize soil pressure, surface loading and settlement on a common elevation datum. Check sensor saturation and negative-pressure capability so the effective-stress inference rests on traceable observations. || 若把泵浦端負壓直接當深層孔壓，會高估深層改良；表面沉陷可能來自上層，尚未壓密的深層土在完工載重後仍會持續沉陷。~Substituting pump suction for deep pore pressure overstates treatment at depth. Surface settlement may occur mainly in upper layers while untreated deeper soil continues settling under the completed structure.
深度負壓傳遞~Suction transfer with depth || 排水板阻力、邊界漏氣與透水夾層會降低深部可獲得的真空效果。傳遞比值是一項診斷量，不是固定材料常數，也不能直接當平均壓密度。~Drain resistance, air leaks and permeable lenses reduce deep vacuum effectiveness. A transfer ratio helps diagnose the system but is neither a material constant nor a direct measure of average consolidation. || 假設泵端負壓幅值75kPa、深部45kPa，幅值傳遞比45/75=0.60；比較須同時刻且同一基準。~With pump suction magnitude75kPa and deep magnitude45kPa, the transfer ratio is45/75=0.60. Compare simultaneous observations on the same reference basis. || 沿排水板不同深度配置測點，將啟動後的時間反應與分區比較。若深部幅值偏低，先查連通、滲漏與感測器，而不是直接增加上部堆載補償。~Observe different drain depths and compare time responses across zones. Low deep suction calls for checking continuity, leakage and sensors before attempting compensation by adding surface surcharge. || 在同一圖上混合不同時間的最大負壓可製造虛假的均勻性；若透水夾層不斷補水，深部可能長期維持較低有效應力而不易從泵表發現。~Combining maxima from different times creates false uniformity. A permeable lens can continuously recharge deep soil and maintain low effective stress without an obvious change on the pump gauge.
漏氣與抽氣平衡~Air leakage balance || 真空系統的可用抽氣能力必須大於進氣，且抽氣量受工作壓力影響。固定流量差只提供控制體的瞬時平衡，不能用額定自由空氣流量替代負壓工況能力。~Available pumping must exceed incoming air and depends on operating pressure. A flow difference is an instantaneous control-volume balance; rated free-air delivery is not necessarily capacity at the working vacuum. || 假設相同參考壓溫下抽氣0.020m³/s、漏入0.002m³/s，淨排氣0.018m³/s；兩流量必須使用相同狀態。~At the same reference pressure and temperature, extraction0.020m³/s minus leakage0.002m³/s gives net0.018m³/s. Both flows require a common state. || 依核准方法分區檢查膜面、封邊與穿透接頭，記錄工作壓力下的流量及功率。比較維修前後壓力恢復，不以單次聽不到漏氣聲作驗收。~Check membrane, perimeter and penetrations by approved procedures, recording flow and power at working pressure. Compare recovery before and after repair rather than accepting solely because no leak can be heard. || 漏氣若集中於接頭，泵浦持續運轉仍可能無法建立目標負壓；以不同壓力基準的流量相減會錯估餘裕，延誤發現膜下系統的持續失效。~A concentrated joint leak can prevent required suction despite continuous pumping. Subtracting flows referenced to different pressures misstates reserve and delays recognition of persistent failure beneath the membrane.
透水夾層補注~Recharge through permeable lenses || 透水砂層可把區外水引進真空區，消耗排水能力並改變負壓分布。達西估算用於辨識補注量級，需先確認連通面積與水力梯度，不把平均土壤滲透係數當局部夾層值。~A permeable lens can feed water from outside the treatment zone and consume capacity. Darcy flow estimates its scale only after connectivity, area and gradient are established; average soil permeability is not the lens permeability. || 取k=1×10⁻⁵m/s、連通面積A=20m²、梯度i=3，Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s；假設飽和層流與均質通道。~With k=1×10⁻⁵m/s, connected A=20m² and i=3, Q=kiA=0.0006m³/s, assuming saturated laminar flow through a uniform path. || 對照鑽探夾層位置、區內外水位與流量變化，檢查補注是否集中於特定深度。隔斷或排水修改須由設計工程師評估周邊沉陷與水文影響後核定。~Compare logged lenses with internal and external heads and flow changes to identify depth-specific recharge. The designer must review neighbouring settlement and groundwater effects before approving cutoff or drainage changes. || 若把持續出水誤當土體正在快速壓密，可能實際只是在抽區外補注水；沉陷速率與孔壓不相符時，累計水量不能證明深層有效應力已提高。~Persistent discharge can be external recharge rather than rapid consolidation. When settlement and pressure disagree, cumulative water volume cannot prove increased effective stress in the treated soil.
排水板水頭損失~Drain head loss || 排水板內部流阻會沿長度消耗負壓，折曲、側向壓力及細料污染都可能降低導水能力。簡化導水係數把流量和水頭差連結，其適用狀態必須與試驗環境一致。~Resistance inside a drain dissipates suction along its length. Folding, confinement and fines reduce flow capacity. A simplified conductance relates flow to head loss only under conditions consistent with the test used to establish it. || 假設排水流量Q=0.0002m³/s、整段水力導通係數C=0.0001m²/s，Δh=Q/C=2m；C不是土壤滲透係數。~For Q=0.0002m³/s and whole-drain hydraulic conductance C=0.0001m²/s, Δh=Q/C=2m. Conductance is not soil hydraulic conductivity. || 檢查排水板在預期側壓、彎曲及土粒條件下的通水試驗，對照深淺孔壓差。把長度與接頭納入流阻模型，避免只採未受壓新品的目錄數值。~Review flow tests under representative confinement, bending and fines, comparing deep and shallow pressures. Include length and connections instead of relying solely on catalogue values for an unconfined new drain. || 排水板壓扁時地表管路仍可能正常抽水，深部負壓卻不能維持；只驗地表排水量會把內部通路瓶頸掩蓋為土層本身壓密較慢。~A flattened drain can limit deep suction while surface plumbing still discharges. Surface flow alone conceals an internal bottleneck and may wrongly attribute delayed treatment to slow soil consolidation.
堆載真空疊加~Surcharge and vacuum combination || 堆載增加總應力，真空降低孔壓，兩者必須用同一測點與同一時刻相加。堆載也可能暫時產生正超額孔壓，因此不能把泵端負壓與填土荷載直接無條件相加。~Surcharge raises total stress while vacuum lowers pore pressure; combine them at one location and time. Filling can also generate positive excess pressure, so pump suction and fill loading cannot be added unconditionally. || 假設該土點Δσ=40kPa、實測淨Δu=−50kPa，Δσ′=Δσ−Δu=90kPa；此孔壓已包含當時各效應。~At a soil point with Δσ=40kPa and measured net Δu=−50kPa, Δσ′=90kPa. The pressure change already includes the combined effects at that time. || 將分期填築重量、孔壓及側向位移畫在同一時間軸，辨別即時反應與排水後狀態。任何加載轉換由岩土工程師依監測及穩定分析批准，避免只看沉陷快慢。~Plot staged fill weight, pore pressure and lateral movement on one timeline, distinguishing immediate and drained states. The geotechnical engineer approves transitions using monitoring and stability analysis, not settlement speed alone. || 若重複扣除真空或忽略加載產生的正孔壓，會高估有效應力與強度；表面沈陷正在加速時，也可能伴隨側向不穩定而非安全壓密。~Double-counting suction or ignoring surcharge-generated pressure overestimates effective stress and strength. Accelerating surface settlement can accompany lateral instability rather than stable, controlled consolidation.
沉陷壓密比例~Settlement based consolidation ratio || 用沉陷推估壓密度需要可靠的最終沉陷及相同荷載歷程。次壓密、地表填土壓縮與量測基準變化會污染此比例，應和孔壓消散一起判讀。~Settlement-based consolidation requires a credible final settlement for the same loading history. Secondary compression, fill compression and datum changes can contaminate the ratio, so interpret it together with pore-pressure dissipation. || 假設僅主要壓密沉陷S=0.24m、預測最終S∞=0.30m，U=S/S∞=0.80；不是任一沉陷讀值都可代入。~For primary-consolidation settlement S=0.24m and predicted final S∞=0.30m, U=0.80. Not every observed settlement component is suitable for this ratio. || 使用深層沉陷分層與孔壓紀錄核對土層貢獻，並檢查最終沉陷預測是否隨新資料更新。卸載條件須同時包含殘餘沉陷及使用需求，由責任工程師核定。~Reconcile layer contributions using depth settlement and pressure records, updating the predicted final value as evidence develops. The engineer sets unloading conditions using residual settlement and service requirements together. || 若最終沉陷估得太小，計算可能提早達到百分之百；卸載後再加永久荷載時，深層未完成的壓密仍會出現，造成路面及鄰接構造差異沉陷。~An underestimated final settlement makes the calculated degree reach full consolidation prematurely. Later permanent loading can expose unfinished deep consolidation and differential settlement at pavements and adjacent structures.
真空中斷恢復~Pressure recovery after interruption || 停機後孔壓回升速度反映漏氣、補注及土體排水的組合，不等於單一材料常數。短期線性斜率可診斷，但不得外推為全部深度的恢復時間。~Pressure recovery after shutdown reflects leakage, recharge and drainage together, not one material property. A short-window linear slope can support diagnosis but does not establish recovery time at every depth. || 假設孔壓由−60kPa於3h回到0kPa，平均恢復率=[0−(−60)]/3=20kPa/h；零點為同一參考狀態。~If pressure recovers from−60kPa to0kPa in3h, the mean rate is20kPa/h, using a common pressure reference. || 分析已核准停機或實際故障的多深度時間序列，同時記錄抽氣、排水與邊界狀態。試驗必須有獨立監測及復原條件，不因教學斜率自行安排停機。~Analyse approved interruptions or actual faults using multidepth records alongside pump, water-flow and boundary conditions. Tests need independent monitoring and recovery criteria; the teaching slope does not authorize a shutdown. || 感測管內漏氣可造成快速回零而非土體真實恢復；若未分辨儀器故障便估計全區負壓消失，可能觸發錯誤決策或掩蓋較慢的深部異常。~Air leaking into a sensor line can produce rapid zero recovery without real soil response. Misreading it as treatment-wide suction loss can trigger wrong decisions or conceal slower deep anomalies.
周界水平收縮~Perimeter horizontal contraction || 真空改善可伴隨向內水平位移，周界附近管線與道路需單獨評估。平均應變只反映兩點距離變化，局部裂縫及轉折可能比平均值更具破壞性。~Vacuum treatment can induce inward lateral movement, requiring separate assessment of perimeter pipes and roads. Average strain describes separation between two points, while local cracks and transitions can be more damaging than the mean suggests. || 假設水平相對位移5mm、觀測基距10m，εh=0.005/10=0.0005，即0.05%；符號與方向須另行記錄。~For relative horizontal movement5mm over10m, εh=0.005/10=0.0005, or0.05%. Record sign and direction separately. || 用穩定區外的測量控制點監測周界及鄰近設施，將軸向位移與接頭容許值比較。檢查基準點是否隨改良區一起移動，避免相對讀值掩蓋整體位移。~Monitor the perimeter and nearby facilities from stable external controls, comparing axial movement with joint limits. Check that reference points do not move with the treatment zone and conceal overall displacement. || 以改良區內樁點當固定基準會低估外部設施變形；平滑平均收縮也可能掩蓋在穿越封邊處集中的開裂，讓管線接頭提早失效。~Using a moving control inside the treatment zone understates external deformation. Smooth average contraction may also hide cracking concentrated at a perimeter crossing and cause premature pipe-joint failure.
卸載回彈預估~Unloading rebound estimate || 移除真空或超載會降低有效應力並產生回彈，不能將所有累積沉陷都當作永久改善量。線彈性重壓模數只描述局部應力範圍，超出範圍或含次壓密需另算。~Removing vacuum or surcharge reduces effective stress and causes rebound, so accumulated settlement is not all permanent improvement. A linear reloading modulus represents a limited stress range; other paths or secondary compression need separate treatment. || 假設卸載幅值Δσ′=30kPa、層厚H=8m、重壓模數M=12000kPa，回彈S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m。~For unloading magnitude Δσ′=30kPa, layer H=8m and reloading modulus M=12000kPa, rebound S=Δσ′H/M=0.020m. || 以卸載回載試驗選定相應模數，對照分層回彈與孔壓恢復。交接文件列出永久載重、剩餘沉陷及監測延續期間，卸載時點由設計者而非單次表面讀值決定。~Select modulus from relevant unload-reload tests and compare layer rebound with pressure recovery. Handover states permanent loading, residual settlement and continued monitoring; the designer determines unloading, not one surface reading. || 若把初次壓縮模數拿來估回彈，結果可能偏差很大；過早結束監測又會漏掉回彈後再壓縮，使完工高程與長期服務性判定失去依據。~Using virgin compression stiffness for rebound can give substantial error. Ending monitoring early misses subsequent recompression and undermines the basis for finished elevation and long-term serviceability decisions.
''')
compact('b192','以能量、孔壓與鄰近振動證據評估動力夯實成效~Evaluate dynamic compaction through energy, pore pressure and neighbouring vibration evidence',r'''
落錘位能尺度~Drop weight energy scale || 動力夯實把落錘位能傳入地盤，但能量分配包含波傳、塑性變形及設備損失。位能不是衝擊峰值力，也不是直接的改善深度；施工參數必須由場址試夯建立。~Dynamic compaction transfers drop-weight energy into ground deformation, waves and losses. Potential energy is neither peak impact force nor improvement depth; field parameters require a site-specific trial. || 假設質量m=15000kg、落高h=15m，在理想條件下E=mgh=15000×9.81×15=2207250J=2.20725MJ，約2.21MJ。~For mass m=15000kg and height h=15m, E=mgh=2207250J=2.20725MJ, approximately2.21MJ, before impact losses. || 核對設備質量與核准作業紀錄中的落高，將能量和試夯後測試結果配對。質量、吊具與安全作業由合格施工團隊管理，本算例僅供桌面能量分析。~Reconcile mass and recorded approved drop height, pairing energy with post-trial tests. Qualified construction personnel control equipment and lifting; the example supports desktop energy analysis only. || 同樣位能在不同土層不會產生相同改善，若用能量達標取代孔壓與密實度驗證，軟弱夾層仍可能存在並在正式載重後造成差異沉陷。~Equal energy does not produce equal improvement in different soils. Energy compliance without pressure and density verification can leave weak layers that later cause differential settlement under permanent loading.
單位面積能量~Energy per treatment area || 能量應按夯點網格與遍數分配，不能只累計全場總量。平均面積能量有助比較試區，卻可能掩蓋網格間及場界的未處理區，需保留空間分布。~Distribute energy by grid and pass rather than only total site energy. Average areal energy compares trials but may conceal gaps between points or at boundaries, requiring spatial records. || 假設每擊取四捨五入E=2.21MJ、同一25m²單元共10擊，EA=10×2.21/25=0.884MJ/m²；非均勻能量場的保證。~Using rounded E=2.21MJ per impact, ten impacts over a25m² cell give EA=0.884MJ/m², without guaranteeing uniform spatial delivery. || 用坐標與時間記錄每次能量事件，和設計網格及遍數核對，再將測試點覆蓋到網格中間及邊緣。漏點須由試驗結果及設計責任人決定補充方案。~Map each event by coordinates and time against the planned grid and passes. Place verification between points and at edges; the designer uses test results to resolve missed treatment areas. || 若重複記錄同一夯點或以全場平均補償漏點，總能量看似足夠卻可能留下連續弱帶；載重跨越弱帶時，差異沉陷會比平均沉陷更嚴重。~Duplicate records or site averages compensating for omitted points can conceal continuous weak bands. Loads crossing those bands may develop differential movement more consequential than the site's average settlement.
經驗改善深度~Empirical treatment depth || 改善深度的平方根經驗式依土類、能量效率及指定單位校準，係數不是通用無因次常數。它只能安排調查與試區尺度，不能取代深度分層的成效驗證。~A square-root depth correlation depends on soil, efficiency and specified units. Its coefficient is not universally dimensionless; use it to plan investigations and trials rather than replace depth-specific verification. || 約定D以m、W以t、H以m，D=n√(WH)；選定經驗n=0.5、W=15t、H=15m得D=7.5m，不是保證改善深度。~With D in metres, W in tonnes and H in metres, D=n√(WH). A calibrated-unit coefficient n=0.5, W=15t and H=15m give7.5m, not a guaranteed treatment depth. || 查明係數的試驗來源及單位慣例，於試區各深度比較施工前後貫入或其他核准測試。若深部未改變，須重查地層及排水條件，不只調整係數配合預期。~Verify the coefficient's evidence and unit convention, comparing approved pre- and post-treatment tests at depth. Unchanged deep material requires reviewing stratigraphy and drainage instead of fitting the coefficient to the desired answer. || 把噸改成公斤卻不轉換係數會大幅誇大深度；即使單位正確，硬殼或軟黏土夾層也可能阻隔能量，使經驗估算無法代表真正改善底界。~Changing tonnes to kilograms without changing the coefficient grossly inflates depth. Even consistent units cannot account automatically for a hard crust or soft clay lens that disrupts energy transfer.
超額孔壓比例~Excess pressure ratio || 飽和地盤受快速衝擊時可產生超額孔壓，使有效應力暫時降低。每一遍之間的排水恢復會影響後續效果，因此須將孔壓時間反應與能量紀錄一起分析。~Rapid impacts in saturated ground generate excess pressure and temporarily reduce effective stress. Drainage recovery between passes affects later performance, so analyse pressure histories alongside energy records. || 假設超額孔壓Δu=60kPa、初始有效垂直應力σ′v0=80kPa，ru=Δu/σ′v0=0.75；分母為初始有效應力而非總應力。~For excess Δu=60kPa and initial effective vertical stress σ′v0=80kPa, ru=0.75. The denominator is initial effective stress, not total stress. || 在代表性深度記錄孔壓峰值及消散，核對感測器動態範圍與時間同步。等待或轉換下一遍的條件須由試夯和穩定分析訂定，不直接採此教學比值。~Record pressure peaks and dissipation at representative depths, checking sensor range and timing. Trial results and stability analysis establish hold or transition criteria rather than adopting the teaching ratio. || 若儀器取樣太慢，峰值可能被平均掉而誤判地盤已恢復；持續施加能量於高孔壓土層，可能增加側向移動而不是獲得預期密實效果。~Slow sampling can average away peaks and suggest premature recovery. Continued impacts in highly pressurized soil may increase lateral movement rather than deliver the intended densification.
鄰近振動衰減~Neighbouring vibration attenuation || 振動傳播受土層、頻率與建物條件影響，經驗距離式只能在校準範圍內比較。峰值粒子速度與加速度不同，單一數字也不能取代對脆弱設施的評估。~Ground layers, frequency and structures affect vibration. A distance correlation is valid only within its calibration range; peak particle velocity differs from acceleration and cannot alone establish acceptability for sensitive assets. || 假設已校準PPV(r)=8mm/s×(20m/r)^1.5，r=40m時PPV=2.83mm/s；指數1.5為選定擬合值，非普遍規律。~For calibrated PPV(r)=8mm/s×(20m/r)^1.5, r=40m gives2.83mm/s. The exponent1.5 is a selected fit, not a universal law. || 用三向地震檢波器記錄波形、頻率與距離，在代表性方位建立現地關係。鄰近管線及歷史建物的允許條件由權責工程師依狀態和規範決定。~Record three-axis waveforms, frequencies and distances to establish site relations in representative directions. Responsible engineers set limits for nearby utilities and heritage structures using their condition and applicable guidance. || 單向感測器或未牢固耦合會低估真實峰值；若地層導波造成局部放大，單靠距離倍增即假設安全會漏掉遠處敏感設施的較大反應。~A poorly coupled or single-axis sensor can underread the peak. Guided waves may amplify remote response, making an assumed safety benefit from distance alone unreliable for sensitive facilities.
夯坑幾何估量~Crater geometry estimate || 夯坑體積反映表面形狀改變，但不能直接等於深層孔隙體積減少。隆起、回填與土體側移需要另行平衡，使用簡化圓錐前應先檢查坑形是否相符。~Crater volume describes surface geometry rather than directly measuring deep void reduction. Heave, backfill and lateral movement need separate accounting; verify shape before adopting a cone approximation. || 假設圓錐坑半徑r=1.5m、深h=0.6m，V=πr²h/3=1.414m³，約1.41m³；不代表相同體積的密實量。~For an ideal conical crater with r=1.5m and h=0.6m, V=πr²h/3=1.414m³, about1.41m³, not the same volume of densification. || 以地表測量網比較施工前後三維形狀，記錄坑周隆起及回填量。將體積平衡與深層試驗一起使用，坑形偏離圓錐時改用實測地形積分。~Survey three-dimensional surfaces before and after treatment, recording rim heave and backfill. Combine volume balance with deep tests, using measured surface integration when shape differs from a cone. || 深坑也可能來自側向擠土或表層破壞，而不表示深部改善；只追求坑深會忽略鄰近隆起、地下管線變形及不均勻回填形成的次生沉陷。~A deep crater may reflect lateral extrusion or surface failure rather than deep improvement. Pursuing depth alone overlooks surrounding heave, utility deformation and secondary settlement from uneven backfill.
乾密度與含水~Dry density and moisture || 密實度評估須分清乾土質量與含水質量，試樣體積與代表性同樣重要。單一點位乾密度不能代表整個深度或面積，應配合分層測試與含水狀態判讀。~Distinguish dry mass from wet mass when evaluating density, with reliable volume and representative sampling. One result does not characterize the full area or depth and needs layered tests and moisture context. || 假設乾土質量Md=1800kg、體積V=1m³，ρd=Md/V=1800kg/m³；若量得濕質量，必須先按含水率換算。~For dry mass Md=1800kg and volume V=1m³, ρd=1800kg/m³. A measured wet mass must first be corrected using water content. || 依核准方法取得代表試樣與含水率，保存取樣深度及體積校正。對照相關規格及試驗不確定性，將不易取樣區明列而非用附近單點值填補。~Obtain representative samples and moisture by approved methods, retaining depth and volume calibration. Compare with relevant specifications and uncertainty, explicitly marking difficult-to-sample areas instead of substituting one nearby result. || 若把濕質量直接計為乾密度，含水較高區會顯得更密實；這種假改善可能掩蓋孔壓未消散與土骨架鬆散，導致錯誤驗收地盤承載狀態。~Using wet mass as dry mass makes wetter soil appear denser. That false improvement can conceal remaining pore pressure and loose fabric, leading to incorrect acceptance of foundation conditions.
平板反力剛度~Plate response stiffness || 平板載重的壓力沉陷比是試驗尺度下的反力指標，受板尺寸與受力深度影響。它不是土壤楊氏模數，也不應直接外推到大型基礎的深層沉陷。~A plate's pressure-settlement ratio is a test-scale response influenced by plate size and stressed depth. It is not soil Young's modulus and cannot directly predict deeper settlement under a large foundation. || 假設壓力q=200kPa、沉陷s=0.010m，k=q/s=20000kPa/m=20MPa/m；單位為壓力除長度，非MPa。~For q=200kPa and s=0.010m, k=q/s=20000kPa/m=20MPa/m. Its unit is pressure per length, not MPa. || 保存完整載重卸載曲線與持荷時間，核對板尺寸、基底整平及位移基準。以相同試驗條件比較前後改善，深層承載及沉陷另由地層模型檢核。~Retain complete load-unload curves, hold times, plate dimensions and displacement references. Compare treatment under consistent conditions and evaluate deep bearing and settlement separately through the ground model. || 表面硬殼可讓小平板呈現高剛度，下面軟層卻未改善；將此反力係數當材料常數會低估大面積載重沉陷，造成對施工成果過度樂觀。~A surface crust can stiffen a small plate while soft material remains below. Treating its response coefficient as a material constant understates settlement under larger loads and overstates treatment success.
設備接地壓力~Equipment ground contact pressure || 施工設備作用地盤的接觸壓力影響作業平台穩定，和改善後永久地盤能力是不同問題。平均壓力不含履帶端部集中、動態反力或偏心，平台需獨立設計。~Equipment contact pressure governs working-platform stability, separately from improved permanent-ground capacity. Average pressure excludes track-edge concentration, dynamic reactions and eccentricity, requiring a dedicated platform design. || 假設設備垂直荷載P=1000kN、總有效接觸A=2m²，q=P/A=500kPa；此為靜態平均值，不是平台許可壓力。~For vertical equipment load P=1000kN over effective A=2m², q=500kPa. This is static average pressure, not allowable platform bearing pressure. || 核對實際接觸面積與設備工況，將平台厚度、排水及下伏軟層納入審查。平台驗收與日常檢查由施工及岩土責任人完成，異常沉陷應先處理再作業。~Review actual contact and equipment states alongside platform thickness, drainage and underlying soft layers. Construction and geotechnical leads approve and inspect the platform; abnormal settlement requires resolution before operation. || 接觸面積若因不平整或坑邊只剩一部分，實際壓力可遠高於平均值；即使場地已改良，局部平台破壞仍可能造成設備傾斜與連鎖風險。~Uneven ground or a crater edge can reduce contact area and raise actual pressure well above average. Local platform failure can tilt equipment even on generally improved ground, creating wider hazards.
貫入阻力改善比~Penetration resistance gain || 施工前後貫入阻力比可顯示改變，但受有效應力、孔壓、測試位置及土層分類影響。成效判讀應檢查完整深度剖面，不能只報全場最大的改善倍率。~Pre- and post-treatment penetration ratios show change but depend on effective stress, pressure, location and soil type. Evaluate full depth profiles instead of reporting only the largest site-wide gain. || 假設同層可比較錐阻力qc由6MPa增至12MPa，比值12/6=2；兩倍錐阻力不是兩倍承載力或所有土層合格。~For comparable same-layer cone resistance rising from6MPa to12MPa, the ratio is2. Doubled cone resistance is not doubled bearing capacity or acceptance of all strata. || 配對前後測線與高程，檢查等待孔壓消散時間、探頭校正及土層變化。對低增幅區保留原始剖面與原因分析，依工程目標逐區簽認而非平均通過。~Match before-and-after locations and levels, checking dissipation time, calibration and stratigraphy. Retain raw profiles and explanations for low-gain zones, accepting against project objectives zone by zone rather than by the average. || 前後測點若落在不同土層，倍數可只是空間差異；只展示好看的結果會掩蓋深部薄弱帶，使上部結構在使用期承受未預期的差異沉陷。~If the two tests intercept different layers, the ratio may reflect spatial variation alone. Selecting favourable results conceals weak bands that later impose unexpected differential settlement on the structure.
''')
compact('b193','連結碎石樁置換率、側向拘束與排水證據判斷複合地盤~Relate stone column replacement, lateral confinement and drainage evidence to composite ground',r'''
方格置換面積~Square grid replacement area || 碎石樁和原土共同承擔荷載，樁面積占單元面積的比例是配置起點。平均直徑不一定代表每一深度的有效斷面，網格邊界與漏樁也會改變實際置換。~Stone columns and native soil share load, making area replacement a starting descriptor. Mean diameter does not establish effective section at every depth, while boundaries and missing columns alter actual replacement. || 假設圓樁直徑D=0.8m、方格間距s=2m，a=πD²/(4s²)=0.1257，約12.6%；只適用完整方格單元。~For circular D=0.8m and square spacing s=2m, a=πD²/(4s²)=0.1257, about12.6%, for a complete square unit cell. || 用竣工坐標與材料記錄核對每個單元，檢查不同深度的可能縮頸。圖面列出場界、障礙及漏樁位置，不能以全場平均替代關鍵基礎下的局部配置。~Reconcile as-built coordinates and material records by cell, checking possible necking with depth. Mark boundaries, obstructions and missing columns instead of substituting a site average for local foundation coverage. || 若將三角網格與方格公式混用，置換率會被誤算；實際縮頸或場界缺柱也可使名義比例失去代表性，集中載重下會增加差異沉陷。~Confusing triangular and square grids miscalculates replacement. Necking or missing boundary columns can also invalidate nominal coverage and increase differential settlement beneath localized concentrated loads.
粒料側向拘束~Aggregate lateral confinement || 碎石柱不是可獨立受壓的鋼筋混凝土樁，粒料抗剪需要周圍土體提供拘束。理想摩擦材料的主應力比顯示拘束重要性，但不能直接當整根柱的承載公式。~A stone column is not an independently supported reinforced-concrete pile. Aggregate shear resistance needs surrounding confinement; an ideal frictional stress ratio illustrates that dependence rather than providing a whole-column capacity formula. || 假設黏聚c=0、摩擦角φ=40°，理想三軸破壞比σ1′/σ3′=(1+sinφ)/(1−sinφ)=4.60；使用有效主應力。~For c=0 and φ=40°, the ideal triaxial failure ratio σ1′/σ3′=(1+sinφ)/(1−sinφ)=4.60, using effective principal stresses. || 對照粒料級配與剪切試驗，評估周圍軟土強度及可能鼓脹區。載重試驗須追蹤沉陷和側向變形，由設計工程師確認是否需要包覆或其他拘束措施。~Review gradation and shear tests together with native-soil strength and potential bulging zones. Monitor settlement and lateral deformation in load tests so the designer can assess additional confinement or encasement. || 上部極軟土不能提供足夠側壓時，柱體可能向外鼓脹；只驗石料本身強度會忽略複合地盤的控制機制，使樁頭沉陷超出設計預期。~Very soft upper soil may not provide adequate lateral restraint, allowing bulging. Testing aggregate strength alone misses the composite-ground mechanism and can leave column-head settlement larger than anticipated.
等應變荷載分配~Equal strain load sharing || 複合地盤中較硬柱體常吸引較多應力，但分配受剛度、變形相容及載重面積影響。等應變單元可說明平衡，應力集中比必須有分析或試驗依據。~Stiffer columns often attract more stress, with sharing governed by stiffness, compatibility and loaded area. An equal-strain cell illustrates equilibrium, but its concentration ratio requires analytical or experimental support. || 假設平均壓力q=100kPa、置換a=0.20、應力比n=σc/σs=4，σs=q/[1+a(n−1)]=62.5kPa，σc=250kPa。~For mean q=100kPa, a=0.20 and stress ratio n=σc/σs=4, σs=q/[1+a(n−1)]=62.5kPa and σc=250kPa. || 以柱頂及土面荷重資料核對單元力平衡，觀察沉陷是否足以支持等應變假設。若柱土分離、局部荷重或墊層拱效應明顯，應重建分配模型。~Check cell equilibrium using column and soil loading evidence and assess whether measured movement supports equal strain. Separation, localized loading or significant mat arching requires a revised sharing model. || 把柱體應力直接等於平均地壓會低估局部需求；反之若假設全部荷載都由柱承擔，會錯估原土變形與長期排水，引致不合理的容量判斷。~Equating column stress with mean pressure understates local demand. Assuming columns take everything instead misrepresents native-soil deformation and drainage, leading to an unreliable judgment of capacity.
柱體排水通量~Column drainage flow || 高透水柱體可提供排水路徑，但是否有效取決於連通、濾層及周圍土進水能力。達西通量只描述選定柱段，不能以柱材高透水性證明全地盤迅速消散孔壓。~A permeable column provides drainage only with connectivity, filtering and inflow from the surrounding soil. Darcy flow describes a selected segment; high aggregate permeability alone does not prove rapid pressure dissipation throughout the ground. || 假設柱材k=0.01m/s、有效A=0.5m²、梯度i=0.2，Q=kiA=0.001m³/s；假設此流速下可採達西關係。~For k=0.01m/s, effective A=0.5m² and i=0.2, Q=0.001m³/s, assuming Darcy behaviour at the relevant velocity. || 檢查粒料與周圍土的濾層相容性，並量測柱內外孔壓的時間差。核對上部排水出口是否暢通，不能只以供料場的滲透試驗替代整個排水系統驗證。~Check filter compatibility with native soil and measure pressure lag inside and outside columns. Verify outlet continuity rather than using quarry permeability tests as acceptance of the complete drainage system. || 細土遷移可堵塞柱周界而讓柱芯仍保持高透水，實際進水卻受限；排水出口封閉時，柱體也可能只重新分配水壓而無法排出地盤。~Fine migration can clog the perimeter while the core remains permeable, limiting inflow. With a closed outlet, the column may merely redistribute pressure rather than discharge water from the ground.
成柱材料體積~Column material volume || 理想圓柱體積有助核對材料帳，但實際投入量含鬆散堆積、地盤擴張及施工損失。材料超量或不足均需解釋，不能直接把卡車運送體積當竣工直徑證明。~Ideal cylindrical volume helps reconcile material, but delivered quantities include loose packing, ground expansion and losses. Both excess and shortage need explanation; truck volume alone does not demonstrate as-built diameter. || 假設D=0.8m、L=10m且等截面，V=πD²L/4=5.027m³，約5.03m³；此為成柱幾何體積，不是鬆散供料量。~For uniform D=0.8m and L=10m, V=πD²L/4=5.027m³, about5.03m³, representing geometric column volume rather than loose delivery. || 以分深度施工紀錄、投入量與材料體積換算核對成柱連續性，異常區配合適用檢測。保存實際深度與平台高程，避免起算面不同導致長度差被誤認成超耗。~Reconcile depth records, quantities and volume conversions to assess continuity, investigating anomalies with suitable tests. Preserve depth and platform datum so different starting elevations are not mistaken for excessive consumption. || 單靠總用量可漏掉上部過度擴張而下部縮頸的柱體；整根帳面體積吻合時，深部薄弱斷面仍可能控制鼓脹或沉陷，無法由平均量排除。~Total quantity can hide an oversized upper segment and a necked lower one. Even a matching volume balance cannot exclude a weak deep section controlling bulging or settlement.
複合地盤壓縮~Composite ground compression || 改良後沉陷取決於有效複合模數與未改善下層，簡化一維估算只適用指定應力範圍。柱土分配模型和模數選定需相容，不能把石料模數直接當整片地盤模數。~Settlement depends on composite stiffness and untreated deeper layers. A one-dimensional estimate applies within a specified stress range; load sharing and modulus must agree, rather than substituting aggregate modulus for the entire ground. || 假設平均新增q=100kPa、改良層H=6m、有效拘束模數M=15000kPa，s=qH/M=0.040m；未含下層與次壓密。~For mean added q=100kPa, H=6m and effective constrained modulus M=15000kPa, s=qH/M=0.040m, excluding deeper layers and secondary compression. || 比較載重試驗、分層沉陷與地層模型，確認模數代表實際應力範圍及排水條件。將改良層與下伏未改良層分項列出，不以小試區結果遮蔽深層貢獻。~Compare load tests, layer settlements and stratigraphy to verify modulus over the real stress and drainage range. List improved and untreated contributions separately instead of allowing a small trial to conceal deep compression. || 若主要軟層延伸到柱底以下，表層改善仍不能消除整體沉陷；將柱材高模數套用全深度，會使估算過小並誤判鄰接構造的差異位移。~Soft soil below column toes can continue dominating settlement despite surface improvement. Extending aggregate stiffness through the full profile produces an unrealistically small estimate and misjudges differential movement.
排水時間尺度~Drainage time scale || 排水能否跟上載重歷程需要比較時間尺度，不只比較滲透係數大小。擴散估算用於提出問題，實際徑向幾何、塗抹區及非線性都可能改變消散時間。~Whether drainage keeps pace with loading requires comparing timescales, not permeability alone. A diffusion estimate frames the question; radial geometry, smear and nonlinearity can substantially change dissipation. || 假設特徵路徑L=1m、擴散係數c=0.05m²/s，t≈L²/c=20s；只是量級，不證明地震期間已充分排水。~For characteristic L=1m and diffusion coefficient c=0.05m²/s, t≈L²/c=20s. This scale does not establish adequate drainage during an earthquake. || 以實測孔壓消散曲線校準係數及邊界，再和設計載重持續時間比較。對快速循環荷載保留瞬態分析，由岩土工程師確認排水效益是否可納入設計。~Calibrate coefficients and boundaries with observed dissipation, then compare with design loading duration. Rapid cyclic loading needs transient assessment before a geotechnical engineer credits a drainage benefit. || 若把慢速試驗的排水改善直接套到短暫地震，孔壓可能來不及消散；高透水材料存在不代表土中水能及時進入柱體，排水效益會被高估。~Transferring drainage benefits from a slow test to a brief earthquake can overstate dissipation. Permeable aggregate does not ensure pore water can enter the column quickly enough during shaking.
柱端壓力尺度~Column toe pressure scale || 柱端荷載和側向傳遞共同決定底部應力，不能假設所有荷載都傳至硬層。端面平均壓力只是一個局部需求量，若柱端坐落軟土，需考慮刺入及下部壓縮。~Toe load and side transfer govern base stress; not all load automatically reaches a hard stratum. Mean toe pressure is a local demand, and a toe in soft soil requires checks for punching and underlying compression. || 假設抵達柱端P=300kN、D=0.8m，qt=P/(πD²/4)=596.8kPa，約597kPa；P不是整根柱頂載重的必然值。~For toe load P=300kN and D=0.8m, qt=P/(πD²/4)=596.8kPa, about597kPa. Toe load need not equal the column-head load. || 以地層及施工深度確認柱端位置，將荷載傳遞分析和分層沉陷比較。對軟硬交界及局部薄硬層特別檢查，不因探頭短暫阻力增加就認定已達可靠持力層。~Confirm toe location from stratigraphy and installation depth, comparing transfer analysis with layer movement. Examine thin hard lenses and transitions rather than treating a brief resistance increase as a reliable bearing stratum. || 薄硬層下仍有軟土時可發生穿刺與整體下沉，柱端壓力再低也不代表安全；錯把短暫施工阻力當成持力層，會使終孔深度缺乏根據。~A thin hard lens over soft soil can punch through and settle as a system. Misreading temporary installation resistance as a bearing layer leaves the chosen termination depth unsupported.
邊緣柱與內柱~Edge and interior columns || 邊緣柱的拘束、荷載分配及排水邊界和內柱不同，不應一律用單元對稱模型。試驗結果比較要說明位置及載重範圍，避免把邊界效應誤認為施工品質差。~Edge columns differ in confinement, load sharing and drainage from interior columns, limiting symmetric-cell assumptions. Comparisons need position and loading extent so boundary effects are not automatically labelled poor workmanship. || 假設可比較沉陷下邊柱載重Pedge=240kN、內柱Pinner=300kN，比值=0.80；這是試驗比較，不是通用邊柱折減係數。~At comparable settlement, hypothetical edge load240kN and interior load300kN give a ratio0.80. This is a test comparison, not a universal edge reduction factor. || 在試區保留邊緣與內部位置的載重及位移資料，核對周圍土與墊層連續性。由設計者評估實際基礎邊界，不把單一位置試驗代表全場每一根柱。~Retain edge and interior load-movement records, checking surrounding soil and mat continuity. The designer evaluates real foundation boundaries rather than using one tested location to represent all columns. || 邊柱外側缺乏拘束可能先鼓脹，若只驗中央柱便會漏掉控制位置；外圍施工障礙又可降低置換率，兩種效應疊加會增加基礎角落沉陷。~An edge column can bulge first where restraint is missing. Testing only the centre misses that condition, while perimeter obstructions reduce replacement and compound settlement near foundation corners.
排水堵塞後孔壓~Pressure after drain blockage || 長期排水維護決定柱體作為水力通路是否仍有效，出口淤塞可使水頭回升。孔壓增量應和荷載及有效應力一起評估，不能把碎石存在視為永遠暢通。~Long-term outlet maintenance determines whether columns remain effective hydraulic paths. Blockage can raise head, and the resulting pressure change must be assessed with loading and effective stress rather than assuming permanent drainage. || 假設局部排水水頭增加Δh=2m，Δu=γwΔh=9.81×2=19.62kPa，約19.6kPa；未改變總應力時有效應力同量下降。~For a local head increase Δh=2m, Δu=9.81×2=19.62kPa, about19.6kPa. Effective stress falls by the same amount if total stress is unchanged. || 交接出口位置、維護通道及基準孔壓，定期比對水位與降雨反應。發現水頭回升時應調查淤積和外部補注，修復方案由維護及岩土責任人共同確認。~Handover records outlets, maintenance access and baseline pressure, with periodic rainfall-response checks. Investigate sediment and external recharge when head rises; maintenance and geotechnical leads jointly approve remedial action. || 若排水失效後仍沿用施工期的有效應力與模數，可能高估服務能力；長期水位回升與附加載重一起出現時，沉陷或局部鼓脹會加速發展。~Retaining construction-stage effective stress and stiffness after drainage loss overestimates service performance. Water-level recovery combined with added load can accelerate settlement or local column bulging.
''')
compact('b194','區分液化觸發、永久變形與改善覆蓋的驗證需求~Separate liquefaction triggering, permanent deformation and verified treatment coverage',r'''
飽和土有效應力~Effective stress in saturated soil || 土骨架承擔的有效應力等於總應力扣除孔壓，地震快速循環可改變孔壓而不立即改變上覆重量。初始狀態必須由地層、地下水與應力歷史共同建立。~Soil-skeleton effective stress is total stress minus pressure. Rapid earthquake cycling can change pressure without immediately changing overburden weight, so initial conditions require stratigraphy, groundwater and stress history. || 假設總垂直應力σv=150kPa、孔壓u=100kPa，σ′v=σv−u=50kPa；此為指定深度的初始狀態，不是液化判定。~At a selected depth with σv=150kPa and u=100kPa, σ′v=50kPa. This is an initial state, not a liquefaction determination. || 以單位重積分核對總應力，將地下水位及測點孔壓轉為同一高程。季節或承壓含水層差異須列成情境，不能用單次乾季讀值代表地震設計水位。~Integrate unit weights for total stress and reconcile water levels and pressures on one datum. Seasonal and confined-aquifer differences need scenarios rather than one dry-season reading representing design groundwater. || 若把總應力當有效應力，循環需求與抗力修正都可能失真；實際水位較高時初始骨架應力更低，原本看似充足的安全餘裕可能消失。~Using total stress as effective stress distorts demand and resistance corrections. Higher actual groundwater reduces initial skeletal stress and can remove an apparently adequate margin in the original evaluation.
循環應力需求~Cyclic stress demand || 簡化循環應力比把地表加速度、應力比與深度折減整合，用於相容方法內的觸發分析。它不是完整時域土體反應，複雜場址與重要構造可能需要更深入分析。~A simplified cyclic stress ratio combines acceleration, stress ratio and depth reduction within a compatible triggering method. It is not a full time-history soil response, and complex sites or important assets may need more detailed analysis. || 假設amax/g=0.30、σv/σ′v=2、rd=0.90，CSR=0.65(amax/g)(σv/σ′v)rd=0.351；各因子都採用無因次比值。~For amax/g=0.30, σv/σ′v=2 and rd=0.90, CSR=0.65×0.30×2×0.90=0.351; all factors are dimensionless. || 核對地震輸入的基準位置、加速度定義及折減係數來源，將採用的震級與持續時間處理方式寫清楚。場址反應需與所選經驗觸發法一致，避免重複修正。~Check motion reference location, acceleration definition and reduction-factor source, documenting magnitude and duration treatment. Keep site-response assumptions consistent with the empirical triggering method to avoid duplicate corrections. || 將基岩加速度直接當地表值或把峰值加速度單位錯用為g，會系統性改變需求；忽略場址放大時，錯誤不會因資料表計算精確而消失。~Substituting bedrock motion for surface motion or confusing acceleration units with g changes demand systematically. Spreadsheet precision cannot correct omitted site amplification or an inconsistent input definition.
觸發抗力比值~Triggering resistance ratio || 循環抗力與需求必須處於同一震級、應力及修正基準，才可相除成觸發指標。比值超過一仍不直接證明永久位移、局部薄層及整體系統皆可接受。~Cyclic resistance and demand must share magnitude, stress and correction references before division. A ratio above unity does not itself establish acceptable permanent deformation, thin-layer response or system performance. || 假設已相容修正CRR=0.40、CSR=0.351，FS=CRR/CSR=1.14；數值是教學比值，不作現地驗收門檻。~With compatibly corrected CRR=0.40 and CSR=0.351, FS=1.14. This teaching ratio is not a field acceptance threshold. || 保存貫入試驗原始資料與每項修正，逐層檢查細料、應力及震級基準是否一致。將抗力與需求的不確定性一併審查，由岩土工程師訂定所需可靠度。~Retain penetration data and every correction, checking fines, stress and magnitude conventions by layer. Review demand and resistance uncertainty together, with the geotechnical engineer defining the required reliability. || 把不同文獻的修正係數任意混用，可能在無察覺下高估抗力；平均比值大於一也可能掩蓋連續薄弱層，造成側移或地盤支承能力突變。~Mixing corrections from incompatible methods can silently overstate resistance. An average ratio above unity may conceal a continuous weak layer responsible for lateral movement or a sharp loss of support.
超額孔壓接近極限~High excess pressure ratio || 高超額孔壓比代表初始有效應力大幅耗減，但實際土體應力路徑及循環剪應變仍重要。不能把一個感測點的比值當整場地同時完全液化的證據。~A high excess-pressure ratio indicates substantial loss of initial effective stress, while stress path and cyclic strain remain important. One sensor cannot establish simultaneous full liquefaction across a site. || 假設初始σ′v0=100kPa、循環增加Δu=95kPa，ru=Δu/σ′v0=0.95；若總應力近似固定，殘餘有效應力約5kPa。~For initial σ′v0=100kPa and cyclic Δu=95kPa, ru=0.95. Approximately fixed total stress leaves about5kPa effective stress. || 量測孔壓須同步加速度與變形，檢查飽和、零點、動態範圍及位置。比較多深度反應，區別儀器截頂、局部噴砂通道與可代表土層的行為。~Synchronize pressure with acceleration and movement, checking saturation, zero, range and location. Compare depths to distinguish clipping, local vent paths and representative layer response. || 感測器量程不足可把更大的反應截成固定值，或漏氣使峰值偏低；只看單點最大比值而不查波形，會錯判液化範圍與後續變形需求。~Insufficient range can clip the response while air leakage can suppress peaks. A single maximum without waveform review can misrepresent the extent of liquefaction and subsequent deformation demand.
分層震後沉陷~Layered post shaking settlement || 震後排水與再密實造成體積變形，沉陷需按層厚與體積應變積分。估計應變應來自合適方法，不能用觸發安全比值直接線性換算地表下沉。~Drainage and reconsolidation after shaking cause volumetric change, requiring integration over layer thickness. Suitable methods establish strains; a triggering factor cannot simply be converted linearly into surface settlement. || 假設兩層厚H1=3m、H2=4m，震後體積應變εv1=0.02、εv2=0.01，S=Σ εviHi=0.02×3+0.01×4=0.10m。~For H1=3m, H2=4m, εv1=0.02 and εv2=0.01, S=Σ εviHi=0.10m, assuming predominantly vertical, one-dimensional reconsolidation of both layers. || 比較震前後水準測量、地下沉陷及地層分布，辨別側移或基礎轉動造成的表觀沉陷。將每層應變來源與適用範圍列入計算書，保留不確定區間。~Compare pre- and post-event levels, subsurface settlement and stratigraphy, distinguishing lateral movement or foundation rotation. Document each layer's strain source, applicable range and uncertainty. || 遺漏薄但高應變的夾層會低估總沉陷；相同平均沉陷在相鄰位置若分布不同，結構接頭可能已超限，不能只用場地總平均判斷可使用性。~Omitting a thin high-strain lens understates settlement. Spatial variation can exceed joint movement limits even with a moderate site average, so average subsidence alone cannot establish serviceability.
側向擴展應變~Lateral spreading strain || 液化區鄰近自由面或斜坡可能產生永久側向位移，對埋管及隧道接頭的需求和垂直沉陷不同。平均剪應變只能描述選定帶寬，局部剪切集中還需細化。~Liquefied ground near a free face or slope can move laterally, imposing demands unlike vertical settlement. Mean shear strain describes a selected band width but does not resolve localized shear concentration. || 假設兩側相對永久位移Δ=0.30m、變形帶寬L=5m，γ≈Δ/L=0.06即6%；這不是由震級直接推算的位移。~For relative permanent movement Δ=0.30m across L=5m, γ≈0.06, or6%. This assumed movement is not derived directly from earthquake magnitude. || 用地表裂縫、測量與地層調查辨識變形帶，沿管線方向分解相對位移。把接頭、支承及穿越位置納入協調，由地工和結構工程師共同判定需求。~Map deformation bands using cracks, surveys and stratigraphy, resolving relative motion along utilities. Coordinate joints, supports and crossings so geotechnical and structural engineers jointly establish demand. || 將位移均勻攤到過長距離會低估局部應變，管線在狹窄剪切帶可先破裂；沒有明顯地表噴砂也不能單獨排除深層側移的影響。~Spreading displacement across too long a distance understates local strain and can miss rupture at a narrow band. Absence of obvious sand boils does not exclude damaging deep lateral movement.
改善抗力增幅~Treatment resistance gain || 改良前後循環抗力比較應保持相同應力及震級基準，且考慮土層代表性。抗力增幅不是安全係數增幅，除非同時證明需求、修正及載重狀態均相同。~Compare cyclic resistance before and after treatment on common stress and magnitude references. Resistance gain is not necessarily a safety-factor gain unless demand, corrections and loading also remain unchanged. || 假設相容CRRold=0.30、CRRnew=0.45，抗力比0.45/0.30=1.50；只有CSR相同時觸發比值才同比增加。~For compatible CRRold=0.30 and CRRnew=0.45, resistance gain is1.50. The triggering ratio increases proportionally only if CSR stays unchanged. || 配對施工前後地層與試驗位置，保存修正後抗力剖面和新增載重情境。用獨立測試或試區檢查低改良區，避免只選最佳位置代表全區成效。~Match layers and tests before and after work, retaining corrected profiles and new loading scenarios. Independently examine low-gain zones rather than presenting the best location as representative of the whole treatment. || 地盤加載可能同時改變有效應力與需求，若只看抗力增加就宣稱風險下降，會漏掉新增結構荷載及水位改變造成的不利效果與空間差異。~New loading can change both effective stress and demand. Claiming lower risk from resistance alone overlooks adverse effects of added structure load, changed groundwater and spatial variation.
樁身震後負摩阻~Post event pile downdrag || 周圍土震後下沉相對於樁身會形成負摩阻，增加樁的軸力需求。簡化沿程均勻剪應力只提供量級，實際中性點、樁土相對位移及荷載轉移需共同分析。~Reconsolidating soil moving down relative to a pile adds downdrag. Uniform interface shear provides a scale estimate, while the neutral plane, relative movement and load transfer require integrated analysis. || 假設樁徑D=1m、受負摩阻長L=8m、平均τ=20kPa，Qdrag=πDLτ=502.7kN，約503kN；不得與同段正摩阻重複計入。~For D=1m, downdrag length L=8m and mean τ=20kPa, Qdrag=πDLτ=502.7kN, about503kN. Do not also credit positive friction over that segment. || 以土層沉陷預估與樁身應變或荷載資料建立相對位移模型，檢查中性點及樁端反應。將震後狀態作獨立荷載組合，由基礎工程師確認容量及服務性。~Combine soil-settlement estimates with pile strain or force evidence to model relative movement, neutral plane and toe response. The foundation engineer checks capacity and serviceability for a distinct post-event load case. || 同一樁段一面計負摩阻需求一面又計滿額正摩阻抗力會重複使用界面能力；震後樁身軸力可能因此被低估，接頭與樁端更容易過載。~Crediting full positive resistance while assigning downdrag on the same segment double counts interface capacity. This can understate post-event axial force and expose connections or toes to overload.
改善範圍證據~Verified improvement coverage || 改良成果需證明空間覆蓋及深度，不只是提交合格試驗的數量。已驗證面積比例適合追蹤資料完整性，未驗證區的位置及連通性仍可能控制整個系統。~Treatment evidence must establish spatial and depth coverage, not merely count passing tests. A verified-area fraction tracks completeness, while the location and continuity of remaining gaps may control system performance. || 假設目標面積1000m²、符合既定證據要求900m²，覆蓋率=900/1000=90%；剩餘100m²不因平均比例高而自動合格。~For a1000m² target and900m² meeting predefined evidence requirements, coverage is90%. The remaining100m² is not automatically acceptable because the overall fraction is high. || 將每個測試、施工柱位與深度範圍放入同一地圖，標記未覆蓋的帶狀或角落區。依控制破壞機制決定補查位置，主管工程師逐區確認證據充分性。~Map tests, treatment locations and depth ranges together, marking unverified strips and corners. Choose supplementary checks by controlling failure mechanism and have the engineer confirm evidence zone by zone. || 未驗證區若形成跨越基礎的連續帶，即使占比小也可能主導側移；以報告頁數或試驗總數替代空間覆蓋，會造成系統安全的假象。~A small unverified strip crossing the foundation can control lateral deformation. Report length or total test count is not spatial coverage and can create a false impression of system reliability.
需求敏感度與交接~Demand sensitivity and handover || 觸發判定對需求及抗力都有不確定性，交接應保留情境範圍和最不利位置。兩個需求值的比較只顯示模型敏感度，不代表地震發生機率或永久變形大小。~Both demand and resistance are uncertain, so handover preserves scenario ranges and controlling locations. Comparing two demand values illustrates model sensitivity, not earthquake probability or permanent deformation magnitude. || 固定教學CRR=0.40時，CSR=0.30得FS=1.33，CSR=0.40得FS=1.00；需求提高會降低同基準抗力比。~At fixed teaching CRR=0.40, CSR=0.30 gives FS=1.33, while CSR=0.40 gives FS=1.00. Higher demand lowers the consistently referenced ratio. || 交接輸入地震、水位、試驗修正及改善覆蓋地圖，列明哪些變更需要重新評估。業主與工程師共同指定監測、震後檢查及重啟條件，避免單一比值取代程序。~Handover motion, groundwater, corrections and coverage maps, identifying changes requiring reassessment. Owner and engineers define monitoring, post-event inspection and reopening conditions rather than replacing procedures with one ratio. || 若新增開挖或地下水改變後仍沿用原比值，風險資料會失去時效；只保存合格結論而未保存假設，接手工程師無法辨識哪些條件已經改變。~Later excavation or groundwater changes can invalidate the original ratio. Retaining only a passing conclusion without assumptions prevents the next engineer from identifying which boundary conditions have changed.
''')
compact('b195','以相對位移、接頭剛度與止水餘量理解隧道耐震接頭~Understand seismic tunnel joints through relative movement, joint stiffness and sealing reserve',r'''
波傳軸向應變~Wave induced axial strain || 地下結構受地震波強迫變形，和地面建物單看慣性力的模型不同。沿隧道方向的簡化平面波可用粒子速度與對應波速估應變，但必須指定方向及波型。~Seismic waves impose ground deformation on tunnels, unlike a model considering only building inertia. A simplified wave along the tunnel relates particle velocity to the corresponding wave speed, requiring an explicit direction and wave type. || 假設沿隧道方向的適用平面波粒子速度v=0.50m/s、對應波速c=500m/s，ε=v/c=0.001；不能代入任意方向的總峰值。~For an appropriate plane wave along the tunnel, particle velocity v=0.50m/s and corresponding c=500m/s give ε=0.001. An arbitrary total peak is unsuitable. || 核對地震輸入的方向、波型與波速剖面，將自由場應變和土結互制分析比較。對斜交波及地層變化保留專門分析，不把此式當所有地震情境的包絡值。~Check input direction, wave type and velocity profile, comparing free-field strain with interaction analysis. Oblique waves and stratigraphic transitions require specific treatment; the relation is not a universal seismic envelope. || 若將剪波速度搭配無關方向的粒子速度，應變需求可被誤估；硬軟地層交界又可集中相對位移，平均波傳模型可能漏掉真正控制的接頭。~Combining shear-wave speed with unrelated particle motion misestimates strain. Stiff-soft transitions can also concentrate displacement, so a mean wave model may miss the joint controlling actual performance.
接頭相對伸長~Joint relative extension || 軸向地盤應變在一段長度上累積成位移，但並非全部都集中在單一接頭。襯砌軸向剛度、地盤摩擦及接頭分布共同決定分配，簡式只是指定分攤情境。~Axial ground strain accumulates over length but does not necessarily concentrate at one joint. Lining stiffness, ground friction and joint distribution govern sharing; the simple relation represents a specified allocation scenario. || 假設ε=0.001均勻作用於L=20m且這段變形分配給所查接頭，Δ=εL=0.020m即20mm；實際分配另算。~If ε=0.001 acts uniformly over L=20m and that segment's deformation is allocated to the checked joint, Δ=0.020m, or20mm; real sharing needs analysis. || 將環縫與縱向接頭位置畫成變形相容圖，檢查位移和襯砌伸長的總和。比較接頭量測及模型結果，對端部、剛度變化與特殊構造另設控制點。~Map circumferential and longitudinal joints in a compatibility diagram, checking the sum of joint movement and lining extension. Compare measured and modelled response at ends, stiffness changes and special structures. || 若把全長地盤位移同時分配到每一接頭，會重複計算需求；若反過來平均分攤而忽略一處特別柔軟，則可能低估該處張開與止水破壞。~Allocating total tunnel displacement to every joint double counts demand. Uniform sharing can instead understate opening at an unusually flexible joint and miss loss of water sealing.
接頭剪切剛度~Joint shear stiffness || 接頭剪切剛度決定位移引起的力，柔性接頭能減少某些力卻可能增加位移與密封需求。線性彈簧只代表特定範圍，間隙、摩擦滑移及損傷會改變關係。~Joint shear stiffness converts movement to force. Flexibility may reduce force while increasing displacement and sealing demand; a linear spring applies only within a range, before gaps, frictional slip or damage change behaviour. || 假設剪切剛度k=50MN/m、相對位移Δ=0.010m，V=kΔ=0.50MN；此為線性範圍的力，不是接頭剪力容量。~For shear stiffness k=50MN/m and Δ=0.010m, V=kΔ=0.50MN. This is linear-range demand, not joint shear capacity. || 用代表性接頭試驗確認力位移曲線、循環退化與溫度條件，將軸向壓力也列入比較。設計須同時檢查力、位移及密封，不能只降低剛度求較小內力。~Test representative force-displacement response, cyclic degradation and temperature, including axial loading. Check force, movement and sealing together rather than selecting low stiffness solely to reduce calculated force. || 若模型忽略接觸閉合後剛度突然升高，峰值力可能被低估；相反，滑移後殘餘變形也可能超出止水能力，即使計算內力看似下降。~Ignoring sudden stiffness increase after contact can understate peak force. Conversely, residual slip may exceed sealing capacity even when the calculated force falls, so one favourable response measure is insufficient.
轉角邊緣張開~Rotation induced edge opening || 接頭轉角會使截面邊緣相對張開，中心位移很小也可能在外緣造成止水需求。小角近似適用於指定旋轉軸，實際多軸運動需組合而不能只採單一截面。~Joint rotation opens edges even when centre movement is small. A small-angle approximation needs a defined axis; multi-axis motion requires combination rather than one section's result. || 假設轉角θ=0.002rad、距旋轉軸R=4m，邊緣位移Δedge≈θR=0.008m即8mm；正負端方向相反。~For θ=0.002rad and distance R=4m from the rotation axis, Δedge≈θR=0.008m, or8mm, with opposite signs on opposite edges. || 使用至少可辨識轉動的多點位移配置，將剛體平移與旋轉分開擬合。核對止水所在實際半徑及安裝偏差，再以經核准的多軸試驗包絡確認需求。~Use multiple displacement points to distinguish rigid translation and rotation. Check the actual seal radius and installation tolerance, then compare demand with an approved multiaxis test envelope. || 單點量測若靠近旋轉中心，會低估邊緣開口；假設整條止水帶承受相同壓縮會漏掉一側失去接觸、另一側過度壓縮的同時發生。~A sensor near the rotation centre can miss edge opening. Uniform seal compression assumptions conceal simultaneous contact loss on one side and excessive compression on the other.
止水壓縮幾何餘量~Seal compression geometry reserve || 止水剩餘壓縮量是幾何量，水密性還取決於材料曲線、老化、表面及水壓。幾何仍有接觸不等於接觸壓力足夠，必須用試驗建立容許的運動範圍。~Remaining seal compression is geometric. Watertightness also depends on material response, ageing, contact surfaces and water pressure. Continued geometric contact does not establish enough contact pressure; testing defines the admissible motion range. || 假設初始壓縮c0=30mm、接頭張開Δ=12mm，cres=c0−Δ=18mm；沒有材料曲線不能算接觸壓或保證不漏水。~For initial compression c0=30mm and opening Δ=12mm, cres=18mm. Without a material curve this cannot determine contact pressure or guarantee watertightness. || 核對密封材料批次、初始壓縮與接觸面公差，採具代表水壓和多軸位移的試驗。把老化後性能與施工偏差納入包絡，驗收由設計與品質責任人共同簽認。~Verify seal batch, initial compression and contact tolerances using representative pressure and multiaxis tests. Include aged performance and installation deviation in the envelope, with design and quality leads jointly accepting evidence. || 止水老化硬化或局部折皺會讓相同壓縮量產生不同接觸狀態；只保留名義幾何餘量可能忽略細小通道，在持續外水壓下逐步發展滲漏。~Ageing or wrinkles can change contact at the same nominal compression. A geometric reserve alone misses small flow paths that can develop into leakage under sustained external pressure.
連接件局部應變~Local connector strain || 接頭連接件的變形集中於有效自由長度，不能把位移除以整支外觀長度稀釋應變。局部塑性、螺紋及錨定區可能先控制，線性應變估算不能直接當疲勞壽命。~Connector extension concentrates over the effective free length, not necessarily its full visible length. Plasticity, threads and anchorage may govern; a simple strain estimate is not a fatigue-life calculation. || 假設連接件有效長L=200mm、伸長Δ=2mm，ε=Δ/L=0.010即1%；是否彈性須另看材料與接頭構造。~For effective length L=200mm and extension Δ=2mm, ε=0.010, or1%. Elasticity depends separately on material and connection details. || 核對自由長度、螺紋及錨定段，將應變量測位置與有限元素或接頭試驗比較。對循環載重記錄殘餘變形與裂縫，不能只看最後一圈的最大力。~Review free length, threads and anchorage, comparing strain locations with analysis or joint testing. Under cycling, record residual extension and cracking rather than only the maximum force in the final cycle. || 把錨固在混凝土中的長度也當可均勻伸長，會低估局部應變；反覆運動可在螺紋根部或接合處累積損傷，即使整體位移仍在名義行程內。~Counting embedded length as uniformly extensible understates local strain. Repeated movement can damage thread roots or connections while overall displacement remains within the nominal stroke.
斷層變形帶需求~Fault deformation band demand || 永久斷層錯動和振動造成的往復變形不是同一荷載情境，需分別評估。將錯距分攤到變形帶只能提供平均幾何需求，實際局部剪切可能更集中。~Permanent fault offset differs from oscillatory shaking and requires a separate scenario. Spreading offset over a deformation band provides only average geometric demand; localized shear may be more concentrated. || 假設相對錯距Δ=0.50m、分布寬L=20m，平均γ=Δ/L=0.025即2.5%；並非斷層位移的預測公式。~For assumed offset Δ=0.50m distributed across L=20m, mean γ=0.025, or2.5%. This is not a formula predicting fault displacement. || 以地質證據建立可能位置及帶寬情境，將永久位移與動態需求交由結構模型分別處理。特殊接頭或擴挖方案須有專案審查，不能用平均應變替代斷層評估。~Define fault location and width scenarios from geological evidence, analysing permanent and dynamic demands separately. Special joints or enlarged sections need project review rather than an average-strain substitute for fault assessment. || 若實際錯動集中於狹窄面，原本分散到長距離的柔性安排可能無效；單一接頭的容量再大也未必容納複合剪切與旋轉，鄰近襯砌可能先受損。~Concentrated offset can defeat flexibility distributed over a long distance. Even a large single-joint capacity may not accommodate combined shear and rotation before adjacent lining is damaged.
串聯柔度分配~Series compliance sharing || 兩個接頭串聯承受相同力而分攤位移，柔度相加不是剛度直接相加。此模型需要相同作用方向且無旁路，土體及其他連接若提供平行路徑必須另建網路。~Two series joints carry the same force and share displacement; add compliance rather than stiffness. The model assumes one direction without bypasses, while ground or other parallel connections require a different network. || 假設k1=100MN/m、k2=50MN/m串聯，keq=(1/k1+1/k2)⁻¹=33.3MN/m；不適用直接並聯相加。~For series k1=100MN/m and k2=50MN/m, keq=(1/k1+1/k2)⁻¹=33.3MN/m, unlike a parallel stiffness sum. || 畫出每個連接的受力路徑並檢查位移相容，用試驗或量測確認同力假設。若一處接頭閉合、摩擦鎖定或碰止擋，必須更新等效剛度與變形分配。~Draw load paths and displacement compatibility, checking the common-force assumption against tests. Closure, friction locking or a stop at one joint requires updated stiffness and movement allocation. || 串並聯判錯會大幅改變需求分配；較軟接頭可能吃掉大部分位移而先超限，若只用平均剛度，會掩蓋局部止水與連接件的控制情境。~Confusing series and parallel paths changes demand allocation substantially. The softer joint can take most displacement and fail first while an average stiffness hides controlling seal and connector conditions.
震後外水壓變化~Post event water pressure change || 地震後接頭需同時面對殘餘位移與可能改變的水壓，密封檢核不能只在無水狀態做。靜水壓增量簡單，但裂縫連通、排水損壞及水頭來源須由現場資料確認。~After shaking, joints face residual movement and potentially changed water pressure. Dry testing alone is insufficient; pressure increment is simple, but fracture connections, damaged drainage and head sources need field evidence. || 假設外側水頭增加Δh=8m，Δu=γwΔh=9.81×8=78.48kPa，約78.5kPa；此為增加值而非總設計水壓。~For an external head increase Δh=8m, Δu=78.48kPa, about78.5kPa. This is added pressure, not total design pressure. || 震後對照水位、滲漏與接頭位移，使用核准的壓力及變形組合評估剩餘功能。檢查排水與備援能力，重啟條件由業主和結構及水工責任人共同確認。~After the event, compare water levels, leakage and joint movement against approved combined conditions. Check drainage and backup systems; owner, structural and hydraulic leads jointly determine reopening criteria. || 若只驗接頭沒有斷裂而忽略外水恢復，密封可能在稍後水頭升高才失效；排水系統同時受損時，漏水後果可能比單一構件損傷更嚴重。~A joint may remain intact yet leak later as water head recovers. Concurrent drainage damage can make that leakage more consequential than the initial visible component damage suggests.
位移容量與交接~Movement capacity and handover || 接頭容量須對應具體運動方向、水壓、老化及循環條件，不能把單軸試驗行程當所有組合的許可值。名義餘量幫助整理，最終仍要查多軸包絡與施工公差。~Joint capacity belongs to a specified direction, pressure, ageing and cycling condition. A uniaxial stroke is not allowable for every combination; nominal reserve organizes evidence but needs multiaxis and tolerance checks. || 假設同一方向相同試驗條件的容量40mm、需求25mm，餘量40−25=15mm；未包含旋轉、剪切及公差互制。~For capacity40mm and demand25mm in the same direction and test conditions, reserve is15mm, excluding rotation, shear and tolerance interaction. || 交接容量試驗、安裝偏差、監測零點及震後檢查流程，逐項核對設計包絡。任何更換密封或連接件都需確認性能相容，責任工程師簽認後更新文件及警戒值。~Handover capacity tests, installation deviations, monitoring zeros and post-event procedures against the design envelope. Replacement seals or connectors require compatibility review and engineering approval before documents and alarms are updated. || 若以最大試驗行程減平均需求，可能忽略最不利接頭與多軸組合；施工初始偏差已消耗部分容量時，表面正餘量不能證明震後仍可維持水密與通行。~Subtracting mean demand from maximum test stroke misses critical joints and combined motion. Initial installation offsets may already consume capacity, so a positive nominal reserve cannot prove post-event sealing or access.
''')
